   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "=== SYMBOLIC ANALYSIS OF TOGGLE SWITCH ===\n",
      "\n",
      "1. Defining symbolic variables and equations...\n",
      "ODEs:\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle \\frac{du}{dt} = \\frac{\\alpha_{1}}{v^{n} + 1} - \\beta u$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Math object>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle \\frac{dv}{dt} = \\frac{\\alpha_{2}}{u^{n} + 1} - \\gamma v$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Math object>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "\n",
      "2. Finding steady states numerically...\n",
      "\n",
      "Found 3 unique steady state(s):\n",
      "  Numeric steady state 1: u = 0.1010, v = 9.8990\n",
      "  Numeric steady state 2: u = 2.0000, v = 2.0000\n",
      "  Numeric steady state 3: u = 9.8990, v = 0.1010\n",
      "\n",
      "4. Analyzing stability using the Jacobian matrix...\n",
      "Jacobian matrix J = \n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "$\\displaystyle J = \\begin{bmatrix} \\frac{\\partial f_1}{\\partial u} & \\frac{\\partial f_1}{\\partial v} \\\\ \\frac{\\partial f_2}{\\partial u} & \\frac{\\partial f_2}{\\partial v} \\end{bmatrix} = \\left[\\begin{matrix}- \\beta & - \\frac{\\alpha_{1} n v^{n}}{v \\left(v^{n} + 1\\right)^{2}}\\\\- \\frac{\\alpha_{2} n u^{n}}{u \\left(u^{n} + 1\\right)^{2}} & - \\gamma\\end{matrix}\\right]$"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Math object>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    },
    {
